#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:12
msgid "Supported Components"
msgstr "支持的组件"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:14
msgid ""
"Tab5X inherits the Tab5 manifest and includes these user-facing packages:"
msgstr "Tab5X 继承 Tab5 manifest，并包含以下面向用户的软件包："

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:16
msgid ""
"`M5UI <../m5ui/index.html>`_: The ``m5ui`` LVGL component library, "
"including ``m5ui.M5Keyboard``."
msgstr ""
"`M5UI <../m5ui/index.html>`_：``m5ui`` LVGL 组件库，包含 "
"``m5ui.M5Keyboard``。"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:17
msgid "`Module <../module/index.html>`_: The ``module`` package for M-BUS expansion modules."
msgstr "`Module <../module/index.html>`_：用于 M-BUS 扩展模块的 ``module`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:18
msgid "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_: The ``unit`` package for Unit drivers."
msgstr "`Unit <../unit/index.html>`_：包含 Unit 驱动的 ``unit`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:19
msgid ""
"`USB <../advanced/usb/device/index.html>`_: The ``usb.device`` package, "
"including HID, mouse, and keyboard support."
msgstr ""
"`USB <../advanced/usb/device/index.html>`_：``usb.device`` 软件包，支持 "
"HID、鼠标和键盘。"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:20
msgid "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_: The ``chain`` package for Chain devices."
msgstr "`Chain <../chain/index.html>`_：用于 Chain 设备的 ``chain`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:21
msgid "`Tab5 <../tab5/index.html>`_: The ``tab5`` package for Tab5 and Tab5X keyboard support."
msgstr "`Tab5 <../tab5/index.html>`_：为 Tab5 和 Tab5X 提供键盘支持的 ``tab5`` 软件包。"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:24
msgid "Supported Display Fonts"
msgstr "支持的显示字体"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:26
msgid ""
"The Tab5X firmware includes the following Montserrat fonts for LVGL and "
"M5UI: ``lv.font_montserrat_12``, ``lv.font_montserrat_14``, ``lv."
"font_montserrat_16``, ``lv.font_montserrat_18``, ``lv.font_montserrat_20``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_22``, ``lv.font_montserrat_24``, ``lv."
"font_montserrat_30``, ``lv.font_montserrat_36``, ``lv.font_montserrat_40``, "
"``lv.font_montserrat_44``, and ``lv.font_montserrat_48``."
msgstr "Tab5X 固件为 LVGL 和 M5UI 提供以下 Montserrat 字体：``lv.font_montserrat_12``、``lv.font_montserrat_14``、``lv.font_montserrat_16``、``lv.font_montserrat_18``、``lv.font_montserrat_20``、``lv.font_montserrat_22``、``lv.font_montserrat_24``、``lv.font_montserrat_30``、``lv.font_montserrat_36``、``lv.font_montserrat_40``、``lv.font_montserrat_44`` 和 ``lv.font_montserrat_48``。"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:33
msgid ""
"For ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``, the firmware also provides ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``, "
"``AlibabaSansJA24``, and ``AlibabaSansKR24`` for Chinese, Japanese, and "
"Korean text respectively."
msgstr "对于 ``M5.Lcd.FONTS``，固件还提供 ``AlibabaPuHuiTiCN24``、``AlibabaSansJA24`` 和 ``AlibabaSansKR24``，分别用于显示中文、日文和韩文。"

