#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:45
msgid ""
"This example controls the PORT.A output, USB Type-A output, and battery "
"charging. It also displays the battery level, voltage, current, and charging "
"state."
msgstr "此示例用于控制 PORT.A 输出、USB Type-A 输出和电池充电，同时显示电池电量、电压、电流和充电状态。"

