#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:57
msgid ""
"This example records up to 10 seconds of 16 kHz, 16-bit mono PCM audio and "
"plays the recording back. The controls update as recording and playback "
"state changes."
msgstr "此示例最长可录制 10 秒的 16 kHz、16 位单声道 PCM 音频，并可播放录音；控制按钮会随录制和播放状态更新。"

