#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:94
msgid ""
"This example controls PORT.A, USB Type-A, and battery charging while "
"displaying battery level, voltage, current, and charging state."
msgstr "此示例用于控制 PORT.A、USB Type-A 和电池充电，同时显示电池电量、电压、电流和充电状态。"

