msgid ""
"This example records up to 10 seconds of PCM audio and plays the recorded "
"buffer."
msgstr "此示例最长可录制 10 秒 PCM 音频，并播放已录制的音频缓冲区。"

#: ../../source/controllers/tab5x.rst:117
msgid ""
"This example reads and displays the three accelerometer and three gyroscope "
"axes."
msgstr "此示例读取并显示加速度计和陀螺仪的三个轴向数据。"

